-> LTR; else RTL. Mixed-text display left to the Unicode Bidi Algorithm
in Word/LibreOffice/Chrome; text never rewritten.

- direction/p2.mjs + p2.test.mjs: 45 tests (20 samples + 25 edge cases)
- spike generator and download-test extension use P2 (checks file
  document.xml unchanged vs variant C)
- docs/spike-docx.md: real-environment checklist, decision record,
  open point on unnamed scripts, repository status
No product code. Step 1 not started.
